# =============================================================================
# Btc scRNASeq - Seurat Analysis Pipeline
# =============================================================================
# Workflow:
#   1. Package installation & loading
#   2. Data loading & Seurat object creation
#   3. Demultiplexing & metadata assignment
#   4. QC filtering (mitochondrial content, Y-chromosome removal)
#   5. DecontX ambient RNA removal
#   6. Blood contamination removal
#   7. Normalisation, variable features, scaling, PCA
#   8. Batch correction (Harmony) & UMAP clustering
#   9. Cluster annotation
#  10. Differential expression (per-cluster FindMarkers + pseudobulk DESeq2)
#  11. Pathway enrichment (GO, KEGG, Hallmark)
# =============================================================================


# =============================================================================
# 1. PACKAGE INSTALLATION & LOADING
# =============================================================================

